=== base ===
# Fleet Maintenance Agreement

This Agreement is made between Drumlin Motor Engineers Ltd (the "Garage") and Eskvale Ambulance Trust (the "Trust").

## 3. Servicing
3.1 The Garage shall service each vehicle every 10,000 miles.
3.2 The Garage shall return each serviced vehicle within 24 hours.

## 8. Courtesy Vehicles
8.1 The Garage shall provide a courtesy vehicle while any vehicle is off the road.
=== amendment ===
# Contract Variation 2

This Variation is made on 10 January 2028 between Drumlin Motor Engineers Ltd (the "Garage") and Eskvale Ambulance Trust (the "Trust").

1. Delete clause 3.2 and replace it with: "The Garage shall return each serviced vehicle within 12 hours."
2. With effect from 1 February 2028, clause 8.1 shall cease to apply.
